('reading','reading_mcq','Education','B1','Why did the person or organization make the change? [R1]','Mina joined an evening English course because she wanted to communicate more confidently at work. At first, she found listening difficult, so she began reviewing short recordings every day. After two months, she noticed that she could understand meetings more easily.','["To solve a practical problem", "To avoid all future work", "To increase confusion", "To reduce the number of users"]','To solve a practical problem','Identify the main reason.',NULL,NULL,'YangLingo Adaptive original practice content',1,NULL),
('reading','reading_mcq','Travel','B1','What happened as a result? [R2]','The city introduced an express bus between the airport and the central station. Buses leave every thirty minutes and tickets can be bought online or from the driver. Passengers with online tickets may board directly without using the ticket machine.','["The situation became easier or more effective", "Everyone stopped participating", "Nothing changed", "The service closed permanently"]','The situation became easier or more effective','Use the final sentence or outcome.',NULL,NULL,'YangLingo Adaptive original practice content',1,NULL),
('reading','reading_mcq','Community','B1','Which statement is supported by the text? [R3]','A local club planned a weekend clean-up in the park. The organizers asked volunteers to bring gloves and reusable water bottles. Because heavy rain was forecast for Saturday, the event was moved to Sunday morning.','["A practical action was taken", "No one benefited", "All details were uncertain", "The plan had no purpose"]','A practical action was taken','Choose the statement supported by the passage.',NULL,NULL,'YangLingo Adaptive original practice content',1,NULL),
('reading','reading_mcq','Technology','B1','What is the main idea? [R4]','A small company replaced its old booking system with a mobile-friendly website. Customers can now change appointments without calling the office, and staff spend less time answering routine requests.','["A serious accident occurred", "A small change led to a useful improvement", "A company hired hundreds of people", "A course was cancelled"]','A small change led to a useful improvement','Summarize the central idea.',NULL,NULL,'YangLingo Adaptive original practice content',1,NULL),
